===== public codex; source lines 630-632 =====
codex
The checks flag a shift toward lower-CTR mobile traffic that accounts for almost all of the observed decline; CTR within platform-country groups barely changed. But v1 appears only before rollout and v2 only afterward, so the data cannot separate v2’s effect from other changes over time—or establish why the traffic mix changed.

